10:02.620 --> 10:04.870
Nice volley, Kotone-chan.

10:04.870 --> 10:07.290
As expected from the woman who
can make the impossible possible.

10:07.290 --> 10:09.880
Idiot, that was nothing.

10:09.880 --> 10:12.670
That kind of catch is easy for me.

10:29.270 --> 10:31.520
Hey, you can actually play.

10:33.610 --> 10:38.200
A battle between rivals should be like this!

10:40.450 --> 10:43.530
Listen up, you better be prepared!

10:43.530 --> 10:47.580
Now we'll show you why we're the
regional favorites. We'll totally crush you.

10:47.580 --> 10:53.710
I'd like to see you try. I'll take everything from you!

10:53.710 --> 10:57.710
I'll use Cougar Mode II and leave you dazzled!

10:58.300 --> 11:00.680
Game count: One-Two.

11:03.600 --> 11:04.810
What is it, Akiyama?

11:04.810 --> 11:07.220
I-I-I'm just excited!

11:18.860 --> 11:20.360
Excuse me.

11:20.360 --> 11:22.400
What a cute girl!

11:22.530 --> 11:27.160
I just wanted to ask where the tennis court is?

11:27.160 --> 11:28.870
It's behind the school build—

11:28.870 --> 11:30.580
We can go there together.

11:30.580 --> 11:32.830
Ah, no. That's okay.

11:32.830 --> 11:34.420
Sorry for bothering you.

11:34.420 --> 11:38.130
Thank you very much. I'll remember this for as long as I live!

11:38.130 --> 11:38.840
W-W-Wait!

11:40.130 --> 11:43.300
You are like a Cupid of love!{leo's figures of speech are as redundant as he is}

11:43.930 --> 11:45.220
What was...?

11:45.220 --> 11:46.300
Dunno...

11:50.310 --> 11:53.350
Sorry, we gave our best...

11:53.350 --> 11:55.440
...yet we still lost.

11:55.770 --> 11:57.810
Good work, you two.

11:57.810 --> 12:03.240
You may have lost, but at least you
made it to the final game against Akadama.{this contradicts line 374, but i'm gonna go with chitose and/or sumino being stupid}

12:03.700 --> 12:07.990
As the Shiradama Club President,
I'm proud of you two!

12:07.990 --> 12:09.490
Chitose-san...

12:10.740 --> 12:12.620
Since you guys worked so hard,

12:12.620 --> 12:14.750
we have to do the same.

12:14.750 --> 12:16.500
Chitose-san, where are you going?

12:17.040 --> 12:18.880
To get something.

12:18.880 --> 12:20.250
Something?

12:20.250 --> 12:22.380
A secret weapon.

12:22.380 --> 12:24.760
I made it myself while in the mountains.

12:26.760 --> 12:29.600
Made it herself while in the mountains?

12:33.270 --> 12:35.230
Cowards deserve only wild boar meat!

12:35.230 --> 12:38.230
Heroes deserve to feast on trained boars!

12:38.230 --> 12:40.570
Hokkaido is such a hell!

12:42.280 --> 12:44.900
There aren't any boars in Hokkaido!

12:44.900 --> 12:46.200
No, thats not it!

12:46.200 --> 12:47.610
Asuna, this is bad!

12:47.610 --> 12:50.280
Chitose-san's all fired up!

12:50.910 --> 12:52.240
Isn't it good to be fired up?

12:52.240 --> 12:53.290
Not at all!

12:53.750 --> 12:55.710
How'd it go?

12:55.710 --> 12:57.620
Reflecting on the practice match?

12:57.620 --> 13:02.050
I found out I still have many flaws.

13:02.050 --> 13:05.340
B-But we also got some strong points.

13:05.340 --> 13:10.140
That's right. Asuna's powerful
lower body and Kotone's instincts...

13:10.970 --> 13:14.220
As long as you continue to improve,

13:14.220 --> 13:16.560
your strengths will make up for the weaknesses.

13:16.560 --> 13:17.390
Yes!

13:17.770 --> 13:18.730
However!

13:18.730 --> 13:21.230
Asuna's legs are already shaped perfectly!

13:21.230 --> 13:23.900
There's no room for improvement!

13:24.820 --> 13:26.740
No way!

13:26.740 --> 13:28.570
Just like Daphne's!{greek nymph, most likely}

13:28.570 --> 13:30.320
You're being too kind!

13:31.450 --> 13:32.410
Who's that?

13:33.120 --> 13:35.830
Hey Asuna, you know her?

13:35.830 --> 13:38.210
What are you talking about, Kotone-chan?

13:38.210 --> 13:41.130
Didn't you meet the last time we went shopping?

13:41.130 --> 13:42.250
Shopping?

13:42.250 --> 13:44.920
That time we met...

13:44.920 --> 13:48.300
Seriha and Sumino and...

13:50.760 --> 13:52.890
Could you be... Leo?!

13:52.890 --> 13:55.270
Long time no see, Kotone-san.

13:55.270 --> 13:55.390
<b>Rising Sun</b>

13:55.560 --> 13:57.680
You're a girl?

13:57.680 --> 13:59.520
Wrong, wrong.

13:59.980 --> 14:01.690
Please!

14:02.110 --> 14:04.570
Let me be a tournament player for Shiradama!

14:04.570 --> 14:07.940
Why? Aren't you the Akadama manager?

14:07.940 --> 14:12.570
Think about what I'm going through here,
even crossdressing as a girl! Please take me!

14:12.570 --> 14:14.910
Ah, all right, all right!

14:15.490 --> 14:16.910
Thank you so much!

14:16.910 --> 14:19.660
Then, to repay you...

14:19.660 --> 14:21.420
I'll give you a massage.

14:22.250 --> 14:23.380
Massage?!

14:34.930 --> 14:38.230
Go back to your cave, you Jungle-Ero-King!

14:38.230 --> 14:40.270
Jungle-Ero-King?!

14:42.100 --> 14:46.480
Hey Azusa, I heard that you won't be the
only first year student in the next game.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.820
They're probably just making
do with the few people they have.

14:48.860 --> 14:51.950
<b>Akadama Middle, 1st Year</b>

14:48.860 --> 14:51.950
<b>Mizumori Azusa (13)</b>

14:49.150 --> 14:52.450
I got on the roster through real skill.

14:52.860 --> 14:56.910
<b>Akadama Middle, 2nd Year</b>

14:52.860 --> 14:56.910
<b>Kazemata Ayakou (14)</b>

14:53.570 --> 14:56.910
Let's show them how much stronger we are.

14:57.200 --> 15:00.660
Try to be as smart and elegant as possible.

15:00.660 --> 15:02.330
Don't worry.

15:02.330 --> 15:06.380
Unlike Sumino-senpai, I don't show my weaknesses.

15:06.380 --> 15:10.630
Azusa, you're so arrogant for a damn first year.

15:10.630 --> 15:13.010
Seriously, I should warn you.

15:13.010 --> 15:16.140
You'll pay if you underestimate your opponents.

15:16.140 --> 15:19.350
Their tennis feels quite unusual.

15:20.140 --> 15:21.770
Sounds interesting.

15:21.770 --> 15:24.190
But, we're...

15:24.190 --> 15:28.070
...not planning to play some nice kiddy tennis.

15:37.330 --> 15:39.330
That's not nice at all!

15:39.700 --> 15:42.000
Is that allowed in the rules?

15:42.000 --> 15:44.330
It's probably fine, since it's just a practice match.

15:45.170 --> 15:46.330
No way in hell.

15:46.710 --> 15:49.630
Service side: Kazemata and Mizumori pair.

15:50.050 --> 15:53.050
Receive side: Akiyama and Fuyukawa pair.

15:53.050 --> 15:54.300
Five game match.

15:54.300 --> 15:55.640
Play ball!

15:55.640 --> 15:59.850
Seriously, why do we have to play against these people?

15:59.850 --> 16:00.930
This kind of match...

16:00.930 --> 16:02.600
I'll crush them quickly!

16:04.900 --> 16:05.690
What?!

16:05.690 --> 16:06.730
The ball multiplied!

16:06.730 --> 16:11.690
That is Azusa-chan's killer spin-less
turning serve, the Seven-Colored Strike!

16:11.690 --> 16:14.570
You'll regret underestimating us!

16:14.570 --> 16:17.120
If you think you can return them, tr—

16:18.370 --> 16:20.080
Wh-What the...?!

16:24.370 --> 16:26.880
Nothing special.

16:26.880 --> 16:29.750
Seven balls came my way,

16:29.750 --> 16:30.800
so I just hit seven balls back.

16:30.800 --> 16:33.130
so I just hit seven balls back.

16:35.050 --> 16:38.510
I think she's the same kind of first year as I am.

16:38.510 --> 16:40.010
How arrogant.

16:40.310 --> 16:41.890
Not bad.

16:41.890 --> 16:44.390
For a warm-up anyway.

16:44.390 --> 16:47.270
She's so arrogant!

16:48.100 --> 16:49.770
Japanese Shadow Clone!

16:49.770 --> 16:52.030
Watch this: Seven-Colored Strike!

16:53.150 --> 16:57.570
<i>Most likely Kurusu-chan is the only
one who can hit those seven balls.</i>

16:57.570 --> 16:58.740
<i>Then I'll...</i>

16:59.320 --> 17:00.370
Yes!

17:01.330 --> 17:03.200
That racket is pretty cool!

17:03.200 --> 17:05.370
<i>The opponent is probably shocked.</i>

17:06.120 --> 17:08.960
<i>My Seven-Colored Strike... by that ridiculous thing...</i>

17:13.340 --> 17:15.970
There's another net above the normal net!

17:17.090 --> 17:19.800
Other than high lobs, no balls shall pass!

17:19.800 --> 17:21.600
It's breaking...

17:22.640 --> 17:24.180
breaking...

17:25.140 --> 17:26.640
breaking...

17:41.950 --> 17:43.660
Confirmed kill.

17:44.160 --> 17:45.410
What?

17:49.000 --> 17:52.170
<b>Second Round</b>

17:50.000 --> 17:50.500
<b>Concluded</b>

17:50.500 --> 17:52.170
<b>Concluded</b>

17:52.170 --> 17:56.590
Anyway, for the next match, who's Eli gonna partner with?

17:56.590 --> 17:57.880
Placeholder

17:56.590 --> 17:58.300
I want to play with Mishi.

17:57.880 --> 18:00.300
Let's decide using rock-paper-scissors.

18:00.300 --> 18:01.140
Okay.

18:01.140 --> 18:03.640
All right, let's start.

18:03.640 --> 18:06.270
Rock, paper, scissors!

18:06.270 --> 18:08.940
Dammit, I lost!

18:09.940 --> 18:14.110
Asuna-san, watch my beautiful stances!

18:14.110 --> 18:16.570
I look forward to your performance, Leona-chan!

18:16.570 --> 18:18.190
So you won.

18:18.570 --> 18:20.320
S-Sorry, what'd you say?

18:20.320 --> 18:20.700
What?

18:20.700 --> 18:23.530
Leona-chan... come here for a bit.

18:23.530 --> 18:25.160
What is it, Asuna-san?

18:26.290 --> 18:30.920
It'll be a problem if they recognize
you, so we have to be careful.

18:32.080 --> 18:33.670
Don't move.

18:38.010 --> 18:40.300
Asuna-san's lipstick...

18:40.300 --> 18:41.800
Could this be a

18:41.800 --> 18:43.090
indirect...

18:45.810 --> 18:49.060
Here, Kurusu-chan. I didn't know you had one.

18:45.810 --> 18:51.560
<b>Awakening
and freedom...</b>

18:49.520 --> 18:51.560
This is to prepare for my acting career.

18:53.060 --> 18:56.190
We'll have to use what we learned from the last game.

18:55.610 --> 18:57.070
<b>Akadama Middle, 2nd Year</b>

18:55.610 --> 18:57.070
<b>Tsuchita Sachiko (14)</b>

18:56.190 --> 18:57.570
Mm, use what we learned.

18:57.610 --> 19:00.400
<b>Akadama Middle, 2nd Year</b>

18:57.610 --> 19:00.400
<b>Nakumo Shiho (14)</b>

18:58.150 --> 19:00.400
She's so tall.

19:00.860 --> 19:03.570
What do you know about them?

19:03.570 --> 19:05.740
Nakumo-senpai?

19:05.740 --> 19:08.120
It's true that her height makes her dangerous,

19:08.120 --> 19:11.160
but that's not her only strong point.

19:11.540 --> 19:14.670
In truth, she's an up-and-coming action superstar.

19:15.590 --> 19:20.260
But because of her height, she always gets adult roles.

19:20.260 --> 19:25.050
Still, she believes that one day she can play a role matching her age.

19:25.050 --> 19:27.680
That's why she's been practicing all this time.

19:28.560 --> 19:30.350
Action superstar.

19:30.810 --> 19:32.850
Have to capture her metamorphosis.

19:34.350 --> 19:36.980
Service side: Nakumo and Tsuchita pair.

19:36.980 --> 19:39.650
Receive side: Owen and Tenchi pair.

19:39.650 --> 19:40.860
Five game match.

19:40.860 --> 19:41.860
Play ball!

19:47.780 --> 19:50.370
Fight!

19:50.370 --> 19:51.290
Placeholder

19:50.370 --> 19:52.210
Work hard!

19:51.290 --> 19:55.290
<i>It's a rare chance to play in front of Asuna-san.</i>

19:55.290 --> 19:59.920
<i>Eli and Tsuchita-senpai keep playing high lobs... I can't even touch the ball!</i>

20:02.970 --> 20:03.930
That kid...<i></i>

20:04.470 --> 20:07.510
<i>Oh, she must be a beginner.</i>

20:07.510 --> 20:11.810
<i>Not letting her touch the ball is kinda mean.</i>

20:12.600 --> 20:16.980
<i>I should give her a {bit of service}a small break,
and play it where she can reach.</i>

20:20.360 --> 20:21.530
<i>It's here!</i>

20:34.120 --> 20:36.210
Yay! I scored!

20:36.210 --> 20:37.210
Did you see my beautiful stance?!

20:37.210 --> 20:38.380
Did you see it?!

20:38.380 --> 20:40.380
My beautiful pose?!

20:40.800 --> 20:41.500
Yay!

20:41.800 --> 20:45.470
Ah, we all saw it really clearly.

20:45.470 --> 20:48.010
Your loyalty, that is.

20:53.060 --> 20:55.690
Nice work!

20:55.690 --> 20:57.650
This way, we can take the lead!

20:57.650 --> 21:00.480
Shut up! We'll just get it back anyway.

21:00.770 --> 21:03.030
That racket was a little too big.

21:03.030 --> 21:04.440
It's all to win!

21:04.440 --> 21:07.160
Y-You'll be my rival!

21:07.160 --> 21:08.160
All right.

21:08.530 --> 21:09.660
Photo, please.

21:09.660 --> 21:11.200
Of me?

21:11.200 --> 21:12.580
That's nice.

21:15.660 --> 21:20.880
Anyway, do you have any goals as a team?

21:20.880 --> 21:22.550
What're you talking about?

21:22.550 --> 21:24.590
If it's about a goal...

21:24.590 --> 21:26.420
...then it has to be the top, of course!

21:26.420 --> 21:27.880
The top...

21:27.880 --> 21:30.180
Even though we won against you in straight sets.

21:30.180 --> 21:32.060
Such an optimistic lot...

21:33.600 --> 21:39.650
That sort of optimism might make it
unexpectedly easy for them, though.

21:40.560 --> 21:42.650
Seriha, did you say something?

21:42.650 --> 21:44.650
No, it's nothing.

21:44.650 --> 21:46.610
Well, we should be heading back.

21:50.490 --> 21:51.620
<i>Seriously...</i>

21:52.160 --> 21:55.450
<i>I look forward to seeing them at the next tournament.</i>

21:53.450 --> 21:54.870
Bye-bye!

21:56.500 --> 21:57.080
Placeholder

21:56.500 --> 21:59.500
All right, let's start training!

21:57.080 --> 22:01.670
<i>And so, with everyone having experienced something new,</i>

22:01.670 --> 22:05.880
<i>Shiradama's first practice match ended.</i>

22:08.970 --> 22:11.800
Senpai! Give me a break !

22:12.100 --> 22:13.470
Shut up, you traitor!

22:29.490 --> 22:30.950
Mom!

22:30.950 --> 22:32.820
Hana-Hana-Hanako is...

22:32.820 --> 22:33.660
What happened?

22:33.660 --> 22:35.290
Did she escape again?

22:35.290 --> 22:38.450
Hanako is in my room!

22:39.410 --> 22:40.080
Eh?

22:53.340 --> 22:58.640
<b><i>I extended my arms up high</i></b>

22:53.340 --> 22:58.640
takaku takaku ude wo nobashita

22:53.340 --> 22:58.640
高く高く腕を伸ばした

22:58.730 --> 23:04.110
<b><i>Knowing that they wouldn't reach</i></b>

22:58.730 --> 23:04.110
todokanai koto kurai wakatteru kedo

22:58.730 --> 23:04.110
届かないことくらいわかってるけど

23:04.230 --> 23:09.440
<b><i>I might be a crybaby</i></b>

23:04.230 --> 23:09.440
nakimushi dakedo sonna jibun mo

23:04.230 --> 23:09.440
泣き虫だけどそんな自分も

23:09.610 --> 23:14.990
<b><i>But I just can't hate myself, so I'm still here</i></b>

23:09.610 --> 23:14.990
kirai ni wa narenakute mada koko ni iru

23:09.610 --> 23:14.990
キライにはなれなくてまだココに居る

23:15.830 --> 23:21.000
<b><i>I dream about a tomorrow that I see far away</i></b>

23:15.830 --> 23:21.000
aa kogareta ashita wa mada tooku de

23:15.830 --> 23:21.000
ああ　焦がれた明日はまだ遠くで

23:21.210 --> 23:25.750
<b><i>It's smiling, beckoning</i></b>

23:21.210 --> 23:25.750
waratte iru temaneki shinagara

23:21.210 --> 23:25.750
笑っている　手招きしながら

23:26.040 --> 23:31.920
<b><i>Count 1 2 3 and raise up your heels</i></b>

23:26.040 --> 23:31.920
ichi ni san kazoe kakato wo agete miru

23:26.040 --> 23:31.920
123　数えかかとを上げてみる

23:32.220 --> 23:36.800
<b><i>Do it a little more, then just a little more</i></b>

23:32.220 --> 23:36.800
mou sukoshi sou ato sukoshi kurikaeshite wa

23:32.220 --> 23:36.800
もう少し　そうあと少し　繰り返しては

23:37.010 --> 23:42.100
<b><i>If I take a breath as deep as I can</i></b>

23:37.010 --> 23:42.100
dekiru dake ookiku iki wo shite

23:37.010 --> 23:42.100
出来るだけ大きく息をして

23:42.270 --> 23:47.150
<b><i>And imagine myself flying in the skies</i></b>

23:42.270 --> 23:47.150
sora wo tobu imeeji wo sureba

23:42.270 --> 23:47.150
空を飛ぶイメージをすれば

23:47.730 --> 23:52.450
<b><i>Then I can go anywhere!</i></b>

23:47.730 --> 23:52.450
doko e datte ikeru yo hora ne

23:47.730 --> 23:52.450
どこへだって行けるよほらね

23:53.660 --> 24:00.240
<b><i>I'm still dreaming of that one day when I might be able to fly</i></b>

23:53.660 --> 24:00.240
itsuka toberu kana nante yume minagara

23:53.660 --> 24:00.240
いつか飛べるかな　なんて夢見ながら

24:11.010 --> 24:14.180
The first ever "Blurt out what comes to mind"!

24:14.180 --> 24:15.180
Starting with Chitose-san!

24:15.180 --> 24:17.220
Stuffing myself with crabs!

24:17.220 --> 24:19.350
I want to become a pink cougar!

24:19.350 --> 24:21.180
Mishi, I love you!

24:21.180 --> 24:22.890
I'll pretend I didn't hear that!

24:22.890 --> 24:25.270
See you next week.

